## Model card

- **Name:** Big Pickle
- **Short description:** OpenCode Zen’s long-running free stealth slot (`opencode/big-pickle`, 200K context, text-only, $0) with disputed and historically mutable underlying model identity/checkpoint behavior.
- **Provider / access:** OpenCode Zen free stealth tier. OpenCode docs/models/Zen pages list `Big Pickle` (`big-pickle`) as an available free stealth model/endpoint, but no stable official model card or fixed checkpoint specification is published.
- **Release / knowledge:** Not officially announced as a stable, versioned named model; evidence indicates the underlying checkpoint may change in place over time. Knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `big-pickle`, `opencode/big-pickle`.
- **Context window:** 200,000 tokens total (32,000 max output) per local metadata; not independently confirmed by an official stable model card.
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-14):** Free $0/$0/$0 on OpenCode Zen for a limited time (per OpenCode docs/privacy notes); data-collection/training/privacy terms described by OpenCode may differ from zero-retention paid models.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed/disputed and potentially mutable; no stable public architecture disclosure.

